        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pacific%2C_Missouri"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "A new depot opened in 1882, and the historic downtown buildings from the late 1800s have been restored and now house new businesses.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        7,
        10
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia",
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pacific%2C_Missouri"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Gustav Grauer Farm, about 4 miles north, was listed on the National Register of Historic Places in 1984.",
